OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court accused of murdering
OL,4,Acare worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith murdering a care worker.
OL,9,FAndrew Bell, 44, from Darlington,
OL,10,Fappeared at Newton Aycliffe
OL,11,FMagistrates' Court charged with the
OL,12,Fmurder of Leanne Park.
OL,14,FPolice were called to an address in
OL,15,FParkgate, Darlington, at about 21:15
OL,16,FBST on Wednesday, where they found her
OL,17,Fbody.
OL,19,FBell was remanded in custody ahead of a
OL,20,Fhearing at Teesside Crown Court on
OL,21,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
